<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden', background: '#0B1120', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 110, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 34, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>怎么证明它真的有用</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 546, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 28, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '26px 22px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 52, fontWeight: 700, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', lineHeight: 1 }}>296</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 12 }}>单元测试</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.55)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>快、确定性，不花钱不联网。修一个 bug 补一条能复现它的用例。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '26px 22px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 52, fontWeight: 700, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', lineHeight: 1 }}>54</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 12 }}>端到端评测</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.55)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>安全红线一票否决，跑之前先复位状态。抓"改坏了"。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '26px 22px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 52, fontWeight: 700, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', lineHeight: 1 }}>43</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 12 }}>端到端验收</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.55)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>真起服务 + 真 JWT，串完整链路。抓"单测旁路掉的东西"。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '26px 22px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 52, fontWeight: 700, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: 'Consolas', lineHeight: 1 }}>32</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', marginTop: 12 }}>前端冒烟</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.55)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>逐个点交互，点了必须有请求。抓"看着能点、其实没反应"。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.08)', border: '1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.30)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '20px 28px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#F8FAFC', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                这四层<span style={{ color: '#38BDF8', fontWeight: 700 }}>不是重复劳动</span>，是各自堵不同的洞：单测旁路认证所以测不到 JWT，端到端只覆盖主路径，前端冒烟抓"点了没反应"。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 64, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)' }}>HomeMind · 智能家居 AI 管家</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>12 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
